    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Isometria!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on an epic journey into the realm of Isometria. Immerse yourself in this procedurally generated universe, where every step unveils new biomes, unique creatures, and a treasure trove of craftable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/7d51b0c9321ddb0918fd55320241c204.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/7d51b0c9321ddb0918fd55320241c204.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/7d51b0c9321ddb0918fd55320241c204.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful weapons, sturdy armor, walls, doors, tables, chairs, and an array of captivating trinkets. Brew potent potions and fashion exquisite jewelry to enhance your prowess in both battle and home life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/eb8954a2a115662666eeaee726de1620.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/eb8954a2a115662666eeaee726de1620.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/eb8954a2a115662666eeaee726de1620.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your adventure armed with just a handful of basic tools, and transform your surroundings through sweat and toil. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/d7cec89b5391853348d40ecc6cd454b0.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/d7cec89b5391853348d40ecc6cd454b0.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/d7cec89b5391853348d40ecc6cd454b0.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter formidable foes, including slimes, goblins, fungos, skeletons, and more. Defeat mighty bosses to harness their powers and forge extraordinary weapons and items. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/fda9f113610a2e52e01bfb88ae2ba793.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/fda9f113610a2e52e01bfb88ae2ba793.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/fda9f113610a2e52e01bfb88ae2ba793.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into mysterious caves, goblin hideouts, ancient tombs, and haunting dungeons to uncover untold riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in online multiplayer or host a dedicated server to invite others to explore your world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 9 distinct biomes, each with its own unique charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight over 40 different enemies, each with their own strategies and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft over 400 unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose melee, ranged, or magical combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically generated world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and gear your character.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Isometria!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on an epic journey into the realm of Isometria. Immerse yourself in this procedurally generated universe, where every step unveils new biomes, unique creatures, and a treasure trove of craftable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/7d51b0c9321ddb0918fd55320241c204.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/7d51b0c9321ddb0918fd55320241c204.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/7d51b0c9321ddb0918fd55320241c204.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful weapons, sturdy armor, walls, doors, tables, chairs, and an array of captivating trinkets. Brew potent potions and fashion exquisite jewelry to enhance your prowess in both battle and home life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/eb8954a2a115662666eeaee726de1620.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/eb8954a2a115662666eeaee726de1620.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/eb8954a2a115662666eeaee726de1620.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your adventure armed with just a handful of basic tools, and transform your surroundings through sweat and toil. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/d7cec89b5391853348d40ecc6cd454b0.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/d7cec89b5391853348d40ecc6cd454b0.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/d7cec89b5391853348d40ecc6cd454b0.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter formidable foes, including slimes, goblins, fungos, skeletons, and more. Defeat mighty bosses to harness their powers and forge extraordinary weapons and items. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/fda9f113610a2e52e01bfb88ae2ba793.poster.avif?t=1754445731\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/fda9f113610a2e52e01bfb88ae2ba793.webm?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596940/extras/fda9f113610a2e52e01bfb88ae2ba793.mp4?t=1754445731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deep into mysterious caves, goblin hideouts, ancient tombs, and haunting dungeons to uncover untold riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in online multiplayer or host a dedicated server to invite others to explore your world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 9 distinct biomes, each with its own unique charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight over 40 different enemies, each with their own strategies and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft over 400 unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose melee, ranged, or magical combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically generated world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and gear your character.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore an isometric world solo or with friends. Battle goblins, giant crabs, mysterious machines, and powerful bosses to gain their powers. Build a community and help the locals take back their world!",
